    {
      "id": "67d44bd30291",
      "name": "weekday-hermes-vault-summary",
      "prompt": "Write a daily Hermes operations summary note to the local container (NOT the read-only vault).\n\nRequirements:\n- Target path: /home/hermes/.hermes/daily-summaries/\n- Create parent directory if needed\n- Create or overwrite today's note at: /home/hermes/.hermes/daily-summaries/Hermes Daily Summary YYYY-MM-DD.md (use today's local date)\n- Before writing, check that the path is writable. If it cannot be created/written due to permissions, report the exact error and do not claim success.\n- The note must be valid Obsidian markdown with frontmatter:\n  tags: [hermes, daily, operations, automation]\n  type: synthesis\n  created: YYYY-MM-DD\n  updated: YYYY-MM-DD\n  sources:\n    - \"[[Hermes Agent Setup and Operations]]\"\n    - \"[[Hermes Operations Dashboard]]\"\n  wiki_status: complete\n- Content sections:\n  1. Summary\n  2. What Ran Today\n  3. Health Signals\n  4. Next Actions\n  5. Related Notes\n- Use concise bullets.\n- Base the note on current live state by checking Hermes status, doctor, cron list, mcp list, and gateway status.\n- After writing the note, verify it by reading the first few lines, then return a short confirmation including the file path written.",
